• **Policies and standards** for data quality, usage, retention, privacy and ethics.
• **Roles**: data owners, **data stewards**, data custodians, a Chief Data Officer; clear accountability.
• **Data quality management**: dimensions such as **accuracy, completeness, consistency, timeliness, validity, uniqueness**; controls, metrics and remediation.
